                                                "sense_id": "4e341b57-d263-3824-8a78-f7baa6aac7de",
                                                "text": "It is common in urban areas that a great many borings exist from prior construction work."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "341ef4b1-6adb-3af1-88b7-e8168584b88a",
