                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "boring",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54487946-3555-3acf-b560-0efd1e7b615b",
                                        "entry_id": "a6cd25a7-f940-308d-a48e-96544bfbc5f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Causing boredom or tiredness; making one feel tired and impatient."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f68a8502-4849-4751-82b3-cec1a1aaa88b",
                                                "sense_id": "54487946-3555-3acf-b560-0efd1e7b615b",
                                                "text": "What a boring film that was! I almost fell asleep."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d6e3e9d-3b22-4d46-be2d-2f23f67095a3",
                                                "sense_id": "54487946-3555-3acf-b560-0efd1e7b615b",
                                                "text": "“Why don’t you become a Baptist preacher?” she interrupted wearily. He smiled at her briefly. Then, from the way he leaned back, adjusted his glasses, took a quick sip of martini, Ida knew she was in for a speech. Biting hard on her back teeth, she sighed and prepared to listen as little as possible. Suffocating, she mumbled, that’s what he is! And boringer than hell!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ee2244f-383d-4fe1-82fb-4ce14892cede",
                                                "sense_id": "54487946-3555-3acf-b560-0efd1e7b615b",
                                                "text": "Oh, let's not spoil a good dinner with a reconcilation^([sic]) scene. We’ve hardly split up. We’ll get to be like two old people who can communicate, and nothing’s boringer than that."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e53f7f7-11b5-42d0-86d9-9f91fa2cd8eb",
                                                "sense_id": "54487946-3555-3acf-b560-0efd1e7b615b",
                                                "text": "“I had the most boring day in life yesterday. I couldn’t go to work with my dad, so I went with my mom.” […] “Mine was even boringer than yours,” Kitty said. She was starting to whine, and she flipped her ponytail. She did both of those things a lot. “I didn’t get to spend that much time with my dad, either, since he’s a pilot.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "607a720b-61c9-4292-a933-a24a3fdc3f3a",
                                                "sense_id": "54487946-3555-3acf-b560-0efd1e7b615b",
                                                "text": "\"We've had some moments in the spotlight, and there will be more to come. But boring is good when operating railways."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "47c7ac94-a8d2-397d-ad1a-bf95029ee51e",
                                        "entry_id": "a6cd25a7-f940-308d-a48e-96544bfbc5f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Suffering from boredom; mildly annoyed and restless through having nothing to do."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Manglish"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3335dbb-765a-4af2-9a97-59e161fa6b34",
                                                "sense_id": "47c7ac94-a8d2-397d-ad1a-bf95029ee51e",
                                                "text": "I very boring.",
                                                "translation": "I am very bored.",
                                                "english": "I am very bored."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d3315b1-4a0b-3e0d-9ef0-4e58fa659fb8",
                                        "entry_id": "a6cd25a7-f940-308d-a48e-96544bfbc5f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used, designed to be used, or able to drill holes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b12c469-fa55-424e-8315-d8c782158ebc",
                                                "sense_id": "1d3315b1-4a0b-3e0d-9ef0-4e58fa659fb8",
                                                "text": "boring equipment"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41a1f374-82c3-4ce8-84cb-8b62c748d7a7",
                                                "sense_id": "1d3315b1-4a0b-3e0d-9ef0-4e58fa659fb8",
                                                "text": "boring snails"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f8547b64-a642-3da6-aebf-8a7b105c2f06",
                                        "entry_id": "a6cd25a7-f940-308d-a48e-96544bfbc5f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capable of penetrating; piercing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
